Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, I'm going on a hunting trip. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second, Jojoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run that by me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn you\Nsaid we were going hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we're going hunting\Nfor hotties with hot bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you should know, I'm a\Nlittle more the romantic type.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'll be able to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to show me the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spoke to Otoishi. He confessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he had quite a lot to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially regarding the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns out he also\Nused it to shoot a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the rat didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it was writhing in agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it freed itself from the arrow\Nand made a break for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't the only organisms with\Nthe potential to acquire stand abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't know what this rat can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we have to hunt it\Ndown before it lashes out.
