Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.82,0:02:22.28,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(139,890)\fs60}Episode 16: {\fs80} Let's Go Hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were just regular cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping a nimble rat within\Nrange won't be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why we have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bearings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll expand your range to 20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be obvious but.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're useless against stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use them when you're in\Nposition to take down the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to use them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even have the concentration\Nfor ball sports and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give it an 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need you to remember one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While on this hunt, when\Ndealing with live animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to prioritize\Ncomposure over speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you corner the rat\Nand screw up the shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't expect it to be gullible\Nenough to come within range again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hold your fire until you\Nknow you can hit your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the pressure bog you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he sure knows how to\Nmake a guy feel at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what he told me, Otoishi shot\Nthe rat near this irrigation canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the location, it\Nwas probably a brown rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brown rats are agile swimmers, adaptable,\Nand can eat practically anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Larger rats can grow up to\N20 or 30 centimeters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some can weigh as\Nmuch as one kilogram,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a horizontal leap\Nof about two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found them. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those aren't bird tracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its forefeet have four\Ndigits and its hindfeet five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The S-shape means it's dragging something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These markings are tail tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat's about 20 centimeters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many, but\Nthere are more than one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a tick on this leaf, which means\Nit's a stomping ground for rodents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in that drain is a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, our best bet is to set a trap\Nand see what the video camera picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of those cameras that lets\Nyou watch while you're recording, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to use\Ncheese for the trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hunk of tempura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheese is too luxurious for a common rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are dead rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like a block of jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you poking it? It's\Nflesh. At some point, the flesh of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these rats melted and later congealed\Nit seems as though the melting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started from under their flesh how\Nin the world does something as messed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up as that even happen don't know if\Ni had to guess i'd say this is the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handiwork of the rat we're after\Nso it's standard this that seems to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the case it took out its fellow\Nrats to seize the territory which
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would mean it's highly likely the\Nrats making a nest in that drain the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,question now is has our culprit used\Nits powers to wreak any more havoc
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like the drainage canal continues\Non to that house it might already be too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,late you think it beat us here at first\Nglance i see a chicken coop but no chickens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cars are still parked in the garage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there doesn't appear to\Nbe any activity in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The front door is unlocked and open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All signs point to the rat being inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to assume the owners of\Nthis house have already been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat will let us approach\Nit up to a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's intelligent enough to know that most\Nhumans are too slow to ever catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's not expecting to\Nbe used as target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how we'll close in and put\Nan end to this mess with one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are rat droppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no grass or grain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The droppings lead to\Nthat room. Come on. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an old\Nrefrigerator compressor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I going crazy or did\Nthe refrigerator just open by itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the door's magnet\Ngive out or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little bastard's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what opened the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me rats could\Nopen refrigerator doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have\Nforgotten to shut it! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get real! Yosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not that gullible, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rat's a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro went into the next\Nroom to look for the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our eyes have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the rat disfigure the owners\Nof this house with its stand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it would have an easier time\Nstoring them in the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it's eating them! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's not coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to kill this thing myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When dealing with live animals, you\Nhave to focus on composure over speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't tag him on my first\Ntry, he'll know my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you said no pressure, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the table and chair are\Npositioned just enough to be in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure I sink this ball\Nbearing right between his beady little eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I move closer, he'll run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blast him from over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's moving! Now!
