Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, it wasn't a fatal blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weird machine must be\Na stand. All right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get some if you think\Nyou've got what it takes to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just know that my next shot is\Ngonna take you out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he's running under the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stan Fire's projectiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I slap it away with my bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hit it with my ball\Nbearing or did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't between his eyes, like\NI said, but he's still a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took out the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hunt is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what were you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went missing right\Nwhen I needed you the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think\Nyou'd abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, at least it's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, everything\Nwent according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well for me that is our\Nrat friend wasn't so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fortunate though his stand\Nshot some needle like
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things at me whatever\Nthey were I bet they're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what turn your flesh to\Ngoo he got to the people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who own this place but\Nthey're still alive I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fix them right up with\Nshining diamond if we
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't eliminate him by\Nsundown things might get
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even messier huh there was\Nanother rat and that one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,managed to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, your hand is melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have dodged the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought catching the needle\Nfor analysis was the best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is a touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and its stand's poison begins to\Npermeate, even melting other stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five or six hits, and you'll turn\Ninto a quivering mass of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good thing that needle didn't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd be\Ngrateful for being squeamish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat bolted out the door\Nafter hitting me with the needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow it must have figured out you\Nkilled its kin here in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry to bother, but would you\Nmind using your power to fix my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd those little SOBs have to multiply?
