Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Speedwagon\NFoundation Research Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Jotaro Kujo\Nspeaking. Jotaro! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've tried to reach you several times!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hunting the rat\Nand had the ringer off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this about Otoishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akira Otoishi was withholding the fact\Nthat he shot two rats instead of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any chance he could\Nhave shot three or four?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sure it's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief, Otoishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to its own territory, it'll\Nkill everything, humans and rats alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cares only about itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this savage's time on Earth is\Nabout to come to a fast end. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, hold on a minute, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pint-sized rodent just\Nran into an open field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly do you plan on\Ntracking this thing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The famous artist Ernest\NThompson-Seaton once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not an animal on the\Nplanet that cannot be tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to know their habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats are known to avoid unfamiliar paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means its root of escape had to\Nbe that irrigation channel from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's something else about rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not constantly eating,\Nthey'll starve within a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are fresh bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an awesome start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're gonna corner\Nthat buck-toothed bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he even gave a\Ndamn that our bait was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His ear looks like a bug-eating leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we call him bug-eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't going to be like at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bug Eaton is going to be extra careful to\Nnot let us get within 20 meters of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B, because of air resistance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ball bearings lose accuracy\Nwhen traveling over 20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a bullet nose like this, we'll be\Nable to hit our mark up to 70 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I have to launch that\Nwith my stand's hand too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think I'm\Nready for that just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to be the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That comment didn't sit well with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who nailed the rat\Nback at the house, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it wasn't exactly a\Nperfect shot, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you're right. Take two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, this puddle\Nis full of leeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful. Eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The footprints suddenly stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they randomly stop like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's under us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have burrowed a\Nhole and covered himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called backtracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know rats could do this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backtracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backtracking is the way\Nin which a wild animal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reverses itself by\Nstepping in its own tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This confuses predators long\Nenough for them to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Japan, the behavior has been observed\Nwith brown bears, weasels, and rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it is unheard of\Namong rats and other rodents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that a common brown rat\Npulled a fast one on us. Things have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken a turn for the worse with this\Nkind of terrain the hunters may have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just become the prey I have this\Ncreepy feeling we're being washed we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better duck behind a rock while we still\Nhave the chance no sudden movements
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good news is bug Eaton's attack isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too fast for us to see\Njust keep an eye out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the point of fire if we can figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where he's hiding, I'll snipe him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dirty rodent used our\Nown rat trap against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I removed the needle\Nbefore the poison spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with all the affected tissue,\Nyou should put a bandage on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was also able to locate\Nhis general whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's halfway up the hill,\Nnear those three rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found him and helped me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who's more\Namazing, you or the rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared with the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel like I'm\Na kid at the grown-up's table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 60 meters away so far no sign of\Nany more needles he knows a random firing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would give away his location and it's\Nobvious he doesn't want to be attacked he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stubborn bastard why are you praising that\Ndamn rat we need to act and we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it now well spoken josuke we need to\Ngive Give this assault everything we've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or Bug-Eaten will kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll give you all four rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this distance, the rounds\Nwill rise like sliders,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so aim one centimeter below the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm firing, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm moving in so he'll shoot his needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job, Josuke, is to\Ndetermine his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm counting on you to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if one or two of his needles get me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can just use shining\Ndiamond to heal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't heal yourself with that\Npower so you get the kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our last dead make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I have a second to prepare?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find him? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as he fired, he ran\Noff and hit somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try getting closer while\Ngoing up the side of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for him to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! I see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little shithiel\Npredicted I'd dodge his
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack and fired the needles\Nat the rocks instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ricocheted at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stand there gawking at me, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes trained on the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment he attacks, blow\Nhis ass straight to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got four rounds,\Nbut I'm out of chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I waste even a single second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the same spot as the last time he\Nfired, but he's hiding behind the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, if only he was looking over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to hit a tiny target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suddenly feel that fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then, it's time for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shosuke missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are. I knew\Nmy miss would make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around. It's good\Nto see that ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And right now you're\Nright in my crosshairs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can hang with\Nthe grown-ups after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me Josuke Higashikata, the mighty\Nvanquisher of pressure and stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akira's mutant stand rats got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are reflections of our\Ndestruction of the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least Josuke is a dependable guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe now we'll all get\Na little peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to\Nexplain, I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face Of\Nthe humic and the ball that I need to,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.56,0:22:58.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.35,0:23:00.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:22:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.34,0:23:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.77,0:23:07.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.53,0:23:13.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.49,0:23:18.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.12,0:23:22.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I need you, but I do,\Nbut I'm trying to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.63,0:23:26.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.17,0:23:31.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.63,0:23:35.01,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
